      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That's not the settings issue (those should tell the game how far the real floor is below the HMD on your head), but rather floor level in the game. With the same height setting, when I try to touch the floor with my controllers, my character's hands either go through the floor on tall avatars or can't reach the floor on short ones. Also, IK's transition from bent knees to tiptoeing syncs to my movement only if I set the height a whole 10cm higher than my real height.",
